    "duplicate_or_wrapper_semantics": "One canonical public declaration, one Registry entry, one publication binding and one authored lesson. The proof derives moment integrability and a numerical moment bound from the MGF premise, rather than repackaging an assumed moment conclusion. The two actual test consumers exercise bounded centered variables and finite independent sums.",
